        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 4SBCS, 4 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis 4 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt with concealed screws is supplied with 3 different strikes, (universal, mortise, and angle strike) for easy installation in almost any application. Contemporary styled with a fully concealed screw design improves security and appearance. The surface mounted door bolt is designed with a unique ball bearing tension system that holds the door bolt in any position, prevents scratching of the bolt, and ensures a smooth sliding action.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-4SBCS.gif?v=1704354618\" width=\"555\" height=\"229\" border=\"0\" alt=\"4 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt Specification\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-surface-bolt-strikes.gif?v=1704354550\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana Door Bolt Strike Plates\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available is other lengths: \r\n<a href=\"/products/2-inch-concealed-screw-surface-bolt-deltana-2sbcs\"><b>DEL-2SBCS 2 Inch Door Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/6-inch-concealed-screw-surface-bolt-deltana-6sbcs\"><b>DEL-6SBCS 6 Inch Door Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/8-inch-concealed-screw-surface-bolt-deltana-8sbcs\"><b>DEL-8SBCS 8 Inch Door Bolt</b></a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/12-inch-concealed-screw-surface-bolt-deltana-12sbcs\"><b>DEL-12SBCS 12 Inch Door Bolt</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana 4SBCS Contemporary Door Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: <b>Solid Brass</b></li>\r\n<li>Bolt Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Width: 9/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1-1/16\"</li> \r\n<li>Door Bolt Strikes: Universal, Mortise, and Angle.</li>\r\n<li>Includes new brass #6-3/4\" mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/4SBCS.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana DEL-4SBCS Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "4 Inch Concealed Screw Surface Bolt, Deltana 4SBCS",
                "description": "4 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt, Deltana 4SBCS - This 4 Inch Contemporary Door Bolt with concealed screws is supplied with 3 different strikes, (universal, mortise, and angle strike) for easy installation in almost any application. Contemporary styled with a fully concealed screw design improves security and appearance. The surface mounted door bolt is designed with a unique ball bearing tension system that holds the door bolt in any position, pervents scratching of the bolt, and ensures a smooth sliding action.\r\n",
